commit message:
Mega commit that rewrites ClassParameter.
We lose a bit of type safety at the ClassParameter constructor:
You can now do things like
ClassParameter<Integer>(optionID, String.class);
But at the other end we can now use nested Generics such as
ClassParameter<Foo<Integer>>(optionID, Foo.class);

Consistent use of :,_ for rdf:x types

rdf:li was the only one which still had : instead of _
@adrianq

Update documentation; Edits to paper.md/paper.bib; New vignette

Fix incorrect entry in documentation for Feb. snow cover fraction;

Edit paper.md for new features and clarity;

Edit paper.bib to remove extra references that are not used and include
new references for climate data;

Add vignette based on Tom's work in README.md to show how to use GSODR
with spatial files and the included climate data;

`get_GSOD` creates data.frame; Replace -9999 with NA; Documentation

* `get_GSOD` will now return a data frame object within R. No need to
save a file and reimport;

* Missing values are now `NA`, previously -9999;

* Update documentation to reflect these changes.

Mainly fix FTP issues thanks to Bob Rudis, other small changes

Updates in Fetch_specified_stations_for_a_range_of_years;

Add option in reformat_GSOD.R to clean a list of files;

